WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.680
If you have no idea where to start your Common App essay

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:04.560
or you're like halfway through the process

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:05.960
and don't know how to continue,

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.720
this is exactly the package for you

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:10.200
because this is where I walk you through every step

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.400
of getting your Common App essay ready to go.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.240
I got into every single college that I applied to

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.680
and $600,000 in merit scholarships,

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:20.240
including a full tuition scholarship to Vanderbilt.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.880
And since then, I've helped over a thousand students

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:23.960
write their college essays,

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:25.500
getting them into crazy schools

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.280
like NYU with full tuition, Vanderbilt with scholarship,

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:31.340
UC Berkeley with Regents scholarship, Penn Cornell,

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:33.720
Dartmouth, Rice, and so many more.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.080
And I would love to help you too.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.420
In this one-on-one package,

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:38.080
I will be walking you through the full step

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.200
of getting your Common App essay ready to go

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.520
using the same strategies

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.560
that I've used to help my students succeed.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:44.720
If you've already started,

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:47.600
we can start based off of wherever you are in the process

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.160
but if you're starting from scratch,

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.240
here's how it will work.

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:52.040
We start with a brainstorming call

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:53.200
where I will walk you through

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.040
all of the seven Common App prompts

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:56.400
and I will help you figure out

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.180
what ideas to put down for each one,

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:00.780
which of your ideas are good, and how to expand on them.

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:03.500
And then I'm going to help you pick the best idea.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.500
So I'm going to help you pick whichever one is most unique

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.120
because I've read a thousand essays

00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:10.280
so I can definitely tell you what stands out.

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:12.480
And then I'm going to help you create an outline for it

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:14.780
so that you know exactly what to put in your essay

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:16.480
to make it stand out and shine.

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:17.420
And then after that,

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:19.540
we're just going to work on revising your essay.

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:20.740
It's a simple process

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:22.820
and it has worked with so many students

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:23.900
and I've gotten the beauty

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:25.940
of getting to see people go from idea

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:27.580
to perfectly polished essay

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:29.300
through these sessions with me.

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:31.780
The best part is that in between each of our calls,

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:33.820
you have unlimited access to me through email.

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:35.520
So if you have any quick questions

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:37.540
about what to do in between calls,

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:38.460
if you get stuck,

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:40.340
are not sure if you want to pursue an idea,

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.060
just email me and I'll get back to you

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:44.300
and give you the help that you need to stay unstuck.

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:46.820
This package genuinely gives you peace of mind

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:49.080
because you know that you're doing your Common App right

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:50.020
the whole way through

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:52.300
and you never have to feel lost, stuck,

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:53.620
or wonder what's going on.

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:56.220
So it's one that my students have really loved.

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:57.180
That being said though,

00:01:57.740 --> 00:01:59.640
if you do struggle to make time to schedule calls,

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:02.580
I also offer an asynchronous version of this package

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:04.820
where you can just get written edits on your Common App.

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:06.700
But I wouldn't recommend that for you

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:09.300
if you are just now starting the process from scratch

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:11.100
and need help actually picking a topic.

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:13.680
That's more for students who already have things written.

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:15.900
I would absolutely love to work with you.

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:18.180
So email me at avigallang at gmail.com

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:20.260
if you have any questions about this package

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:22.660
and otherwise you can book right here on my website

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:24.220
while I still have availability.

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:26.160
I cannot wait to work with you.
